# paperclip routines skills

Use this skill for scheduled work, recurring checks, reusable Paperclip skills,
and skill consolidation proposals.

## scope
- routines list and detail
- routine triggers and runs
- Paperclip skills list, content, and version history
- shared skill promotion proposals

## protocol
1. Read local company routine or skill state first.
2. Compare against similar companies only at the pattern level unless Zay asks
   for direct cross-company detail.
3. Draft consolidation as a proposal. Publishing or updating skills is Tier 3.

## commands
```sh
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/routines --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /routines/<routine_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/skills --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /skills/<skill_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /skills/<skill_id>/versions --company-id <company_id>
```

## output
State whether this is a company-local recommendation or cross-company pattern.
